{"after_excerpt":{"locator":{"extraction_ref":"asset:sha256:19b1460e9d09a07eb91135287ca5844dd236b10fc5ed23bd6e94d2859ae859f4","joiner":"","kind":"HTML_TEXT_SPANS","output_sha256":"6f825052070cb8862304edc2f59e275bd524158ecbd97941ea52a1e7e5eb48b4","raw_text_sha256":"c92cfbfae5aa47f173d7442fe8ea954947f9cc3d11f9eeb32a6932cc504fd1a5","schema_version":2,"spans":[{"end":3275,"start":3098,"unit_ref":"html:1"}]},"text":"凡〈男女〉居父母及〈妻妾居〉夫喪而身自〈主婚〉嫁娶者杖一百若〈男子〉居〈父母〉喪〈而〉娶妾妻〈居夫喪〉女〈居父母喪而〉嫁人為妾者各減二等若命婦夫亡〈雖滿服〉再嫁者罪亦如之〈亦如凡婦居喪嫁人者懝斷〉追奪〈勅誥〉並離異知〈係居喪及命婦〉而共為婚姻者〈主婚人〉各減五等〈財禮入官〉不知者不坐〈仍離異追財禮〉若居祖父母伯叔父母姑兄姊喪〈除承重孫外〉而嫁娶者杖八十","text_sha256":"c92cfbfae5aa47f173d7442fe8ea954947f9cc3d11f9eeb32a6932cc504fd1a5"},"before_sha256":"41faa51bc95a32fcade7c8ea5f5507acc51adbe909c67569a3497458478e01ae","before_source":{"bibliography":{"citation":"《大清律例》（四库全书本）卷十","url":"https://zh.wikisource.org/wiki/%E5%A4%A7%E6%B8%85%E5%BE%8B%E4%BE%8B_(%E5%9B%9B%E5%BA%AB%E5%85%A8%E6%9B%B8%E6%9C%AC)/%E5%8D%B710"},"carrier_capture":{"ref":"asset:sha256:ddacd6d2c41f42848594247d289b52bc635e84c3d39176f2ccdad9b9bdb53e26","sha256":"ddacd6d2c41f42848594247d289b52bc635e84c3d39176f2ccdad9b9bdb53e26"},"container":{"ref":"asset:sha256:94afcbef9f638b17b5a5482d90111d1742baa30c97f6f048cb4c3508af52256c","sha256":"94afcbef9f638b17b5a5482d90111d1742baa30c97f6f048cb4c3508af52256c"},"id":"src:history:daqinglu:v10:mourning-marriage","locator":{"section":"居丧嫁娶"},"locator_verification":{"reason":"EXCERPT_NOT_FOUND","status":"UNVERIFIED"},"notes":"支持丧制会实际约束婚嫁；不能直接给元妃之丧计算宝玉宝钗唯一婚期。","text":"凡男女居父母及妻妾居夫喪而身自嫁娶者杖一百。若居祖父母伯叔父母姑兄姊喪而嫁娶者杖八十。","text_sha256":"0bcfb345739b828f866e940a48f44f4c2fac712e8642f94102e84deebadbadc1","title":"《大清律例》卷十——居丧嫁娶","type":"HISTORICAL_PRIMARY","witness":{"annotation":"户律·婚姻·居丧嫁娶","label":"《大清律例》卷十","siglum":"DQLL-V10"}},"claim_reviews":[{"claim_id":"claim:history:h03:mourning-constrains-marriage","claim_sha256":"2a98fa2be1dec15e59fecbcad482321d69b5e7c6507dd83babf23bbb5f126dca","rationale":"恢复完整条款及承重孙例外后，丧制限制婚嫁的存在性主张仍获支持；所有亲属类别不能按统一罚则处理，亦不推出元妃之丧的唯一婚期。","result":"RETAIN_EXISTING_ASSERTION"}],"impact":{"claims":[{"authority_scope":"HISTORICAL_FEASIBILITY","id":"claim:history:h03:mourning-constrains-marriage","kind":"HISTORICAL_MECHANISM","modality":"DIRECT_ASSERTION","statement":"《大清律例》的居丧嫁娶条说明丧制会实际限制婚嫁。","status":"SUPPORTED","support":[{"relation":"DIRECT","source":"src:history:daqinglu:v10:mourning-marriage"}]}],"decisions":[],"implementations":[],"title_axes":[]},"impact_sha256":"3fc06fdcb817eda097e1e316c6b2ca2497c22285c59fd5078ea027391e4a376b","kind":"SOURCE_EXCERPT_CORRECTION","limitations":["此项为代理对本地数字录文及下游主张的复核，不冒充独立人工评审；逐字重取不等于馆藏原件或历史真实性鉴定。","保留原Source ID、type、witness、tier、bibliography和notes，以及全部Claim、Decision、Implementation与TitleAxis记录和权限。"],"omitted_line_breaks":[],"rationale":"采用从“凡〈男女〉”到“杖八十”的完整连续录文，恢复夹注界符、〈主婚〉、〈除承重孫外〉与被无标记删掉的娶妾、命妇、主婚人等中间条款。原主张仅为丧制限制婚嫁，仍成立；不能据此锁定小说人物唯一婚期或忽略承重孙例外。","reviewer":{"kind":"AGENT_TEXT_REVIEW","name":"Codex"},"schema_version":1,"source_id":"src:history:daqinglu:v10:mourning-marriage"}
